      'text.51250c6aa5a6':
        'Use a vegetarian cheese if desired. Stock absorption varies; add a splash of water if the rice needs more time.',
      'text.e9af60e0e9e2':
        'Warm the stock in a small saucepan. Slice the mushrooms and finely chop the onion.',
