      'A colourful bowl of fresh vegetables, chickpeas and greens':
        '新鮮な野菜とひよこ豆、葉野菜の彩りボウル',
      'Leafy salad with colourful fresh vegetables': '彩り豊かな野菜と葉物のサラダ',
